WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.683
Welcome to Module 1 of the
learning path Defender X D R

2
00:00:03.683 --> 00:00:08.225
Engineering and Operations:
architecture, access and onboarding.

3
00:00:08.225 --> 00:00:12.175
Before any prevention setting
matters, two things have to be true.

4
00:00:12.175 --> 00:00:16.525
The right people can see and act on
the service, in the tenant's own cloud.

5
00:00:16.525 --> 00:00:19.225
And the sensor is on
every device it should be.

6
00:00:19.225 --> 00:00:23.559
In this module you learn the service's
shape and its government-cloud limits,

7
00:00:23.559 --> 00:00:26.242
you set who can do what,
and you prove the sensor's

8
00:00:26.242 --> 00:00:28.925
coverage with a query
whose result you can file.

9
00:00:28.925 --> 00:00:34.063
The module covers Steps 1 and 2 of the
Defender X D R implementation guide.

10
00:00:34.063 --> 00:00:38.212
It takes about forty minutes, plus
Lab 2 in your own test tenant.

11
00:00:38.212 --> 00:00:44.313
The path covers Windows clients and
Windows Server only, for a civilian agency

12
00:00:44.313 --> 00:00:49.340
in Microsoft three sixty-five G C C,
with notes for G C C High and D O D.
